Maintainer: Nick McKay <nick@nau.edu>
Description: Age-uncertain chronology development for paleogeoscientific
    data, including age modeling with Bacon, Bchron, OxCal, and BAM, and
    LiPD (Linked Paleo Data) model infrastructure. Ensemble analysis is
    provided by the 'ens' package and visualization by the 'lipdViz'
    package; geoChronR imports and re-exports both, so the complete
    geoChronR 1.x API remains available by loading this package.
